    <div class="section-title">Summary & Legal Determination</div>
    <div class="notes-box">
        <strong>Statutory Assessment:</strong> All mandatory declarations specified under the Legal Metrology (Packaged Commodities) Rules, 2011 are duly present, legibly displayed, and meet statutory requirements based on automated verification.
        
